                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwoŋ ri ŋata timo cal m'opay kosa cal m'onyel je m'obedo amien ri Rwoth, tic ma cingi jandijo ma cwec to lamo manyaliŋliŋ. Ji je joladwoko ni, “Obedi Ameno!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.15",
